    <h1>🎵 Sentence Piano — Teacher's Guide</h1>
    <p class="tagline">A music‑and‑literacy tool for diverse learners — Foundation Levels A–D to Level 2 (Year 2), English &amp; Music.</p>
    <div class="rule"></div>
    <p>Sentence Piano turns typing into music: every letter plays a note, whole sentences play back as melodies in 4/4 time, and children can shape the rhythm of what they write. It builds <strong>fine motor control, keyboard and typing skills, letter–sound knowledge, early writing and core music concepts</strong> at the same time — with immediate see‑hear‑do feedback and sound that always stays in tune.</p>

